# Cloudflare Pages `_redirects`
#
# Format (NOT TOML): `<from>  <to>  <status>`, one rule per line.
# Status 200 makes this a rewrite rather than a redirect: the URL stays as the
# user typed it while index.html is served, which is what a client-side router
# needs to hydrate deep links like /dashboard or /stats on a hard refresh.
#
# This must stay LAST — Cloudflare evaluates rules top to bottom and the splat
# swallows everything. Requests that match a real file on disk are served
# directly and never reach this rule.
/*    /index.html    200
